      "detailsHtml": "<p><strong>Bug Fixes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Fix compose runtime crash when <code>remember()</code> key parameter invokes a Composable function (<a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/315855015\">b/315855015</a>)</li>\n <li>Fix Compose runtime crash when <code>return@</code> is used. (<a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/315821171\">b/315821171</a>)</li>\n <li>Avoid using absolute paths in memoization keys which allows better build cache utilization. (<a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/313937484\">b/313937484</a>)</li>\n</ul>",
      "commitsUrl": "https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/support/+log/756b7ad84884595dc9fae5ab1aa29cd329d89308..f492f14dbbb4d25d9371bd8171f4308ec5f241c8/compose/compiler"
